00:00:13,350 --> 00:00:16,030
决定了谁富谁穷。
determine who's rich and who's poor.

7
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:20,070
许多人希望能够消除
Many hope to erase the divide

8
00:00:20,070 --> 00:00:23,110
富人和穷人的隔阂，
between the haves and the have nots,

