贫穷会遗传吗？
Could poverty be genetic?

11
00:00:37,060 --> 00:00:41,890
空间，时间，生命本身。
Space, time, life itself.

12
00:00:45,110 --> 00:00:48,930
宇宙的奥秘，尽在穿越虫洞。
The secrets of the cosmos lie through the wormhole.

13
00:00:55,460 --> 00:00:59,460
贫穷会遗传吗？

14
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:07,720
法老、国王、伟大的实业家和CEO们，
Pharaohs, kings, great industrialists and C.E.O.s.

15
