是否违背了自然法则。
contradict the laws of nature.

26
00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:44,060
我成长的地方周围的人都没钱，
Where I grew up, nobody had much money.

27
00:01:44,060 --> 00:01:45,970
起码我们都不知道谁是有钱人。
Nobody we knew, anyhow.

28
00:01:45,980 --> 00:01:49,110
总会有一些富人，
Rich people were out there, somewhere,

29
00:01:49,110 --> 00:01:52,950
但对于我们来说，他们就像是火星人。
but to us, they may as well have been Martians.

30
00:01:52,950 --> 00:01:54,320
我们非常缺钱，
Money was so scarce

31
00:01:54,320 --> 00:01:56,870
以至于我要在邻居家周围
that I went around the neighborhood

32
00:01:56,870 --> 00:01:58,320
捡废瓶子。
collecting bottles.

33
00:01:58,320 --> 00:02:02,110
