00:32:33,130 --> 00:32:34,670
不公平的回报
So, unequal pay would be

592
00:32:34,670 --> 00:32:37,120
我们无法得到确切等量的报酬。
we don't get exactly the same amount.

593
00:32:37,120 --> 00:32:40,470
不公平回报意味着你比我更加努力工作，
Inequitable pay would be that maybe you do a harder job

