他就必须获得所有社会阶层的
he has to maintain the support of monkeys

643
00:34:42,430 --> 00:34:44,410
猴子的支持，
at all levels of society.

644
00:34:44,410 --> 00:34:46,630
它必须遵循社会规则，
He must observe social rules,

