00:37:07,250 --> 00:37:09,080
牧人可以决定是否在这里放牧。
whether or not to graze their cattle.

690
00:37:09,080 --> 00:37:13,250
增加牛数量产生的利益是个人的，
The benefits of adding a single cow are individualized,

691
00:37:13,250 --> 00:37:15,220
但增加的牛的成本
but the costs of adding that cow

